<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<TimeML xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="TimeML_1.2.1.xsd">
  <DOCID>manuela</DOCID>
  <TIMEX3 tid="t0" type="DATE" value="2020-12-31T00:00:00" functionInDocument="CREATION_TIME" temporalFunction="false">2020-12-31</TIMEX3>
  <TEXT>Il signor Franco, di anni 62 viene <EVENT eid="e1" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">accompagnato</EVENT> al PS dal 118 perché presenta <EVENT eid="e2" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">cefalea</EVENT> generalizzata, <EVENT eid="e3" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">acufeni</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e4" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">nausea</EVENT> e <EVENT eid="e5" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">vomito</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e6" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">bradicardia</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e7" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">vertigini</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e8" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">crisi</EVENT> convulsive e <EVENT eid="e9" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">alterazioni</EVENT> dello stato di coscienza. Il signor Franco soffre di <EVENT eid="e10" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ipertensione</EVENT> arteriosa, <TIMEX3 tid="t1" type="DATE" value="2018" temporalFunction="false">2 anni fa</TIMEX3> gli è stata <EVENT eid="e11" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">diagnosticata</EVENT> la <EVENT eid="e12" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">fibrillazione</EVENT> atriale, e per questo è in <EVENT eid="e13" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">trattamento</EVENT> con anticoagulante. Il medico decide di fare una <EVENT eid="e14" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">TC</EVENT> Cranio che <EVENT eid="e15" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">evidenzia</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e16" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">l'aumento</EVENT> della PIC a causa di <EVENT eid="e17" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">un'emorragia</EVENT> cerebrale. Verosimilmente da attribuire alla presenza di un <EVENT eid="e18" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">picco</EVENT> pressorio. Il paziente viene operato d’urgenza e a fine <EVENT eid="e19" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">intervento</EVENT> viene <EVENT eid="e20" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">posizionato</EVENT> un drenaggio per il <EVENT eid="e21" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">monitoraggio</EVENT> della PIC.&#13;
</TEXT>
